{{Spell}}

==Requirements==
Spell is unlocked after achieving 5 [[Quasi-Realms#Delusions|Delusions]] in the [[Quasi-Realms#Thunderous Justice|Thunderous Justice Quasi-Realm]].

==Details==
Simulates a number <math>N</math> of {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Magic Missile}} casts, equal to:

<math>\left\lfloor \left( C_{E} \times 0.001 + 1 \right) ^ {1.35} \right\rfloor + 100</math>

granting Mana, equal to:

<math>M \times \left( K \times N + 1 \right) \times E \times 30</math>

''Note: This increases {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Magic Missile}} casts, Casts This Exile, Casts This Realm, and Total Casts.''

[[:Category:Spells#Persistent_Spells|Passive:]] Increases casts of a random (non-Persistent) spell on panel by:

<math>K \times \left( \left( C_{R} \times 0.05 \right) ^ {0.8} \times 0.01 + 1 \right)</math>

''Note: This increases Casts, Casts This Exile, Casts This Realm, and Total Casts.''

where:
* <math>N = \text{Number of simulated Magic Missile casts}</math>
* <math>U = \text{Current spell charges}</math>
* <math>K = \text{Charges used} = \left\lfloor (U - 1) \times 0.2 \right\rfloor + 1</math>
* <math>M = \text{Mana per Second}</math>
* <math>E = \text{Evocation Efficiency}</math>
* <math>C_{E} = \text{Jas'Aham's Missile Storm Casts This Exile}</math>
* <math>C_{R} = \text{Jas'Aham's Missile Storm Casts This Realm}</math>

